  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/01/IMG_7514.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(39 fotos) La pe&ntilde;a Vacas, Toros y Cerveza ha entregado este fin de semana sus trofeos a los mejores detalles de vacas en la Pascua Taurina de Onda (Lancera, de La Paloma de Xal&oacute;), Les Penyes en Festes de la Vall d&#39;Uix&oacute; (Irachi, de Alberto Granchel de Quatretonda) y el concurso Ciudad de Segorbe (Decidida, de La Paloma).</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/premiospenavacastorosycerveza2016/img_7472.jpg\" alt=\"img_7472\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/premiospenavacastorosycerveza2016/img_7473.jpg\" alt=\"img_7473\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/premiospenavacastorosycerveza2016/img_7474.jpg\" alt=\"img_7474\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/premiospenavacastorosycerveza2016/img_7475.jpg\" alt=\"img_7475\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/premiospenavacastorosycerveza2016/img_7477.jpg\" alt=\"img_7477\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/premiospenavacastorosycerveza2016/img_7480.jpg\" alt=\"img_7480\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/premiospenavacastorosycerveza2016/img_7482.jpg\" alt=\"img_7482\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/premiospenavacastorosycerveza2016/img_7485.jpg\" alt=\"img_7485\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4